'''Red Snowcannon''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] gun obtained by finishing in the Top 100 on the tokens collecting leaderboard {{Currency|Snow Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Snowcannon]], but it's color scheme has been altered to red colors.

== Trivia ==
* It has [[Silver Snowcannon|silver]], [[Bronze Snowcannon|bronze]] and [[Gold Snowcannon|gold]] variants.
* Like all the other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (Except [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].

